# Your own clicks in the demo, played right after CONFIG > Planner > Video Device Start and before
# the tour's screen-by-screen clicks, exactly as written.
#
# Record them: run `dist/planner --record` (or --demo), use it normally, and copy the lines it
# prints in the terminal into this file. Each `screen` line starts a block; its clicks follow.
#
#   screen plan
#   click plan-zoomicon
#   click map@0.40x0.40          a point in the map: across, then down, as fractions of its box
#   click map@0.50x0.50:right    the right button
#   key Escape
#   type 100                     typing is not recorded: add a type line where you typed
#
# A `#` starts a comment. With no lines below, the demo plays nothing extra here.
